/_site/
/.quarto/
*.html.bak
.DS_Store
*__pycache__*

# Rendered HTML belongs in _site/. Stray .html in the source tree are
# single-file `quarto render` artifacts — never commit them.
*.html

# ...except reference-versions.html: hand-authored JS (not a render artifact),
# wired into _quarto.yml as an include-after-body for the reference pages.
!reference-versions.html

# team/index.qmd is generated by scripts/generate_team.py from the package
# registry (data/packages.yaml) and the member overlay (data/members/). It
# is committed so the site builds without network access; those data/ sources
# are the single source of truth.

# Generated at render by scripts/gen_versions_manifest.py (pre-render step)
reference/versions.json

# Local project/AI instructions — not part of the published site
CLAUDE.md
